  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low Emissions and Climate Resilient Agriculture Risk Sharing Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will establish a risk sharing Facility that will unlock innovative and scalable financial instruments to support CSA investments.

&#x2022; The program capitalizes on GCF additionality to develop new products and mobilize private-sector investors in the climate-smart agriculture sector. 
&#x2022; It promotes local capacity and is aligned with the notion of country ownership by working closely with local financial institutions. 
&#x2022; The program has high ptoentail for replicability and scalability, as CSA has been identified as key priority by various countries to meet their nationally determined contribution goals.</narrative>
  </description>
